A :TRY whose protected body holds only a comment before :CATCH.
try_structure fires once on the :TRY when the :CATCH is reached; the
empty-looking :CATCH body is legal and must not be flagged
(diag.try_structure).
-- input.ssl --
:PROCEDURE NotifyOwner;
	:PARAMETERS sOwner;
	:TRY;
		/* send the notification here;
	:CATCH;
	:ENDTRY;
:ENDPROC;
-- format --
:PROCEDURE NotifyOwner;
	:PARAMETERS sOwner;
	:TRY;
		/* send the notification here;
	:CATCH;
	:ENDTRY;
:ENDPROC;
-- diagnostics --
3:2-3:6 error try_structure: ':TRY' requires at least one statement before ':CATCH' or ':FINALLY'
-- diagnostics [--strict --info] --
